    "long_instructions": "# Opening Reflection\r\n\r\nBefore you begin the AI 101 Professional Learning Series, take a moment to reflect on your goals.\r\n\r\nYou may want to learn about new AI tools, feel more confident explaining AI to a 5th grade student, explore ways AI can support differentiation in your classroom, or develop strategies to help teachers monitor AI use.\r\n\r\n> In the **reflection box** below, answer the following question: If you were to describe your goal in a hashtag, what might it be?\r\n",
